# ...but not the tactile library's resident block, whose name collides with
# the core-dump pattern above.  Unignoring it matters: load_core() treats a
# missing file as "no principles", so a checkout without it silently ships an
# empty prompt block instead of failing.
!capx/tactile_memory/core.yaml
